{"version":1,"key":"card:447","content":{"id":447,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"print","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可用于打印一个表达式，这个表达式要么是字符串，要么将自动转换为字符串。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可同时打印多个表达式，是用逗号分隔，参数之间会插入一个空格字符"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> name = 'Gumby'\n>>> salutation = 'Mr.'\n>>> greeting = 'Hello,'\n>>> print(greeting, salutation, name)\nHello, Mr. Gumby","language":"py","uuid":"9873ce26-cfeb-49b1-a221-c40013ede4e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sep","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 自定义分隔符"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> print(\"I\", \"wish\", \"to\", \"register\", \"a\", \"complaint\", sep=\"_\")\nI_wish_to_register_a_complaint","language":"py","uuid":"d6501a12-8435-498a-86da-990124892ef2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"end","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 自定义结束字符串，以替换默认的换行符"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"print('Hello,', end='')\nprint('world!')","language":"py","uuid":"24fe187d-3091-4f3d-9f76-926ae3751a2b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python"],"createTime":1719155825652,"updateTime":1743303640440,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640440}}